  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Libya Community Based Protection and PMEAL Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A multi-year protection program aimed at increasing the response and coping capacities of at-risk communities in Libya to the external risks that threaten their physical and psychological welfare. The program will consist of three main phases: 
1. phase one (6-12 months): mapping, building trust, identifying communities/branches.&#xa0;
2. phase two: trainings and National Society Development
3. phase three: tailored&#xa0;protection activities.</narrative>
  </description>
